  "prefLabel": "Den 101.07 Certified dental assistant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.07 “Certified dental assistant” means a dental assistant who holds current certified dental assistant certification from the Dental Assisting National Board (DANB).\n\nSource. #12427, eff 12-6-17; renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.05)",
